measuring_reference.description:
measuring reference of the event; Supported values are {ASSET, SITE}
measuring reference SITE is required in case of export limiting.
For individual Asset/Function level control, measuring reference is ASSET

start_time.description:
Start time of the event;
If it not sent, it is set to the current time rounded to the next minute
Start time must be within 7 days

end_time.description:
End time of the event;
Optional but one of end_time or duration must be passed
Maximum supported event duration is 300 mins and minimum supported event duration is 5 mins
